{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "or-search-dutch-stemming-2026-11-25",
		"name": "OpenRegister Dutch Search Stemming API",
		"description": "_search finds an inflected Dutch form (change search-dutch-language-quality, task 1.5; REQ-SDL-001).\n\nAn object titled \"Omgevingsvergunning bouwen\" and a control \"Kapvergunning\". The capability `openregister.search.stemming` and `GET /api/settings/search` say whether this database stems. On PostgreSQL (stemming `dutch`) `_search=omgevingsvergunningen` finds the permit and only it, although the plural is no substring of the title; without stemming (the MySQL job) the plural finds nothing. The singular finds the permit and not the control on every database.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
